#: src/kioskgui.cpp:174
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Your system contains KDE configuration settings in the skeleton "
"directory <b>%1</b>. These files are copied to the personal KDE settings "
"directory of newly created users.<p>This may interfere with the correct "
"operation of user profiles.<p>Unless a setting has been locked down, "
"settings that have been copied to the personal KDE settings directory of a "
"user will override a default setting configured in a profile.<p><b>If this "
"is not the intended behavior, please remove the offending files from the "
"skeleton folder on all systems that you want to administer with user "
"profiles.</b><p>The following files were found under <b>%2</b>:"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dien Systeem bargt KDE-Instellen binnen den Vörlagen-Orner <b>%1</b>. "
"Disse Dateien warrt na de KDE-Instellenornern vun nieg toföögt Brukers "
"kopeert.<p>Dat mag wesen, dat verdreegt sik nich mit dat Funkscheneren vun "
"Bruker-Profilen.<p>Is en Instellen nich fastsett, gaht de Instellen, de na "
"en Bruker sien Instellenorner kopeert warrt, de Standardinstellen binnen de "
"Brukerprofilen vör.<p><b>Is dat nich dat, wat Du wullt, muttst Du de "
"Instellendateien, mit de Du Arger hest, ut de Vörlagenornern op all "
"Systemen, op de Du Profilen bruken wullt, wegmaken.</b><p>Disse Dateien "
"wöörn binnen <b>%2</b> funnen:"

